cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the maps it produced, please cite both the software and the data record."
title: "ASEAN multi-hazard flood atlas: code for the SAFE 2026 release"
abstract: >-
  An open-source pipeline that produces coastal, fluvial and pluvial flood-depth maps at 30 m
  for Singapore, Kuala Lumpur, Bangkok and Jakarta, for the present day and for SSP2-4.5 and
  SSP5-8.5 at 2050 and 2100, with the bare-earth terrain calibration and the frozen validation
  lists used to test it.
type: software
version: safe2026-v4.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
